<lb n="1"/>Unnser <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fründtlich</unclear> willig <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">dinnst</unclear>, sampt <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">waß</unclear> wir erenn
